      "category": "weak_support",
      "finding_summary": "Section 6.3 infers that date precision 'depends on how much attention an opening receives' from 17 of 18 ceremony projects versus 2 of 26 others dated to the day. These counts appear in no table, and a ceremony article would also report the date, so the comparison does not isolate attention.",
