      "evidence_summary": "The LLM relevance and date extraction is run over 3,187 articles at a stated cost of NOK 70. Section 8 says the steps 'done by hand in this paper should be automated: grouping articles on the same project into one record, and matching each project to a road segment in NVDB'. Section 3.2 notes that the automatic duplicate check missed near-identical online and print versions of one article. Table 7 fields were coded by keyword search with hand checks. Treatment data (dated, georeferenced project records) are therefore produced by an LLM step plus manual steps. The NOK 70 figure is not backed by a displayed calculation or run log.",
