      "finding_summary": "The abstract concludes from one broad search term ('sykkelvei') in a 70-hit, five-week pilot that 'keyword search alone is too noisy and that an LLM filter is needed'. The paper reports a far narrower alternative term ('åpning sykkelvei') but does not test it or any non-LLM filter.",
